{{.Schema}}

Rules:
- Escape every backslash inside a JSON string as "\\": a namespace like
  OA\Property or a regexp like \d otherwise makes the report unparsable.
- "schema_version" must be "{{.SchemaVersion}}".
- "reviewer.id" must be "{{.AgentID}}".
- "number" must be {{.Issue.Number}}.
- "labels" contains only names from REPOSITORY LABELS, at most {{.MaxLabels}}.
- "status" is one of: {{join .Statuses ", "}}.
- "confidence" is a number between 0 and 1.
- "evidence" is required and must cite a file and line, a commit, a pull
  request or an issue number. Write "none" only with status needs-info.
- "duplicate_of" is required when status is duplicate-of.
- "question" is required when status is needs-info.
